  "statuteText": "125-S:3 Fund Established. –\n\nThere is established a motor vehicle air pollution abatement fund, which shall be administered by the department of environmental services. This fund shall be used for costs incurred by the department in the course of carrying out activities that are designed to reduce air pollution in the state from the mobile source sector. All fees and monetary grants, gifts, donations, or interest generated by these funds shall be deposited with the state treasurer in a special nonlapsing fund to be known as the motor vehicle air pollution abatement fund and shall be continually appropriated to the department for the administration of this chapter."
